{"text":"延昌四年二月二日，佛弟子白洛生姊樂普念造釋加牟尼佛并二菩薩。願願從心，爲一此衆生及含成佛。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"白洛生","refId":null,"text":"白洛生","start":12,"end":15},{"name":"PersonName","term":"樂普念","refId":null,"text":"樂普念","start":16,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋加","start":20,"end":22},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"菩薩","refId":null,"text":"菩薩","start":27,"end":29},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":38,"end":40}]}